  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 408.01 Lakes Covered",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 408.01 Lakes Covered. Saf-C 408 shall only apply to moorings on Lake Winnipesaukee, Squam Lakes, Lake Sunapee, Lake Winnisquam, Newfound Lake, Ossipee Lake, Bow Lake, and Pleasant Lake.\n\nSource. #4145, eff 10-6-86; ss by #4384, eff 3-10-88; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES, 5-3-95 (formerly Saf-C 408.02); ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95; ss by #6815, eff 7-24-98; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; ss by #9731, eff 6-24-10; ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13; ss by #12398, eff 10-1-17",
